        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 26 at 2:03AM EDT until September 27 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Boston/Norton MA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 45 mph.

* WHERE...In Connecticut, Hartford CT, Tolland CT, and Windham CT
Counties. In Massachusetts, Northern Worcester MA, Northern
Middlesex MA, and Eastern Hampden MA Counties.

* WHEN...Until 8 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
